"float-left\" style=\"width: 200px\">\n\t<span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 738px; \">\n      <span class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\" style=\"padding-bottom: 97.50000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"></span>\n  <picture>\n          <source srcset=\"/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/8ac56/fumilemon.webp 240w,\n/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/d3be9/fumilemon.webp 480w,\n/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/65afa/fumilemon.webp 738w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 738px) 100vw, 738px\" type=\"image/webp\">\n          <source srcset=\"/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/8ff5a/fumilemon.png 240w,\n/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/e85cb/fumilemon.png 480w,\n/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/774b6/fumilemon.png 738w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 738px) 100vw, 738px\" type=\"image/png\">\n          <img class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\" src=\"/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/774b6/fumilemon.png\" alt=\"My icon image\" title=\"My icon image\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\">\n        </picture>\n    </span>\n\t<figcaption>My favorite icon written by my friend at <a href=\"https://tabelog.com/kyoto/A2601/A260302/26019556/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ばちや百万遍</a>.</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<div>\n<p><strong>I’m a PhD student at <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/doku.php/en:start\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Yoshikawa, Ma Lab</a>, <a href=\"https://www.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Kyoto University</a>.</strong>\n<strong>I work on my doctoral studies under the supervision of Prof. <a href=\"https://yangcao88.github.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Yang Cao</a>, Prof. <a href=\"https://www.db.soc.i.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~yoshikawa/index-en.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Masatoshi Yoshikawa</a> and Prof. <a href=\"http://www.cs.emory.edu/~lxiong/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Li Xiong</a>.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>My research interests are privacy and security enhancing technologies in data engineering, especially in, Differential Privacy, Federated Learning, Trusted Execution Environments.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>I love Soccer ⚽️ and Beer 🍻.</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h3 id=\"recent-news\" style=\"position:relative;\"><a href=\"#recent-news\" aria-label=\"recent news permalink\" class=\"anchor before\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a>Recent News</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><em>(2023/05)</em> Our paper “OLIVE: oblivious federated learning on trusted execution environment against the risk of sparsification.” is accepted by <a href=\"https://vldb.org/2023/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">VLDB 2023</a> 🎉</li>\n<li><em>(2023/05)</em> Our paper “From Bounded to Unbounded: Privacy Amplification via Shuffling with Dummies” is accepted by <a href=\"https://csf2023.ieee-security.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CSF 2023</a> 🎉</li>\n<li><em>(2023/04/01)</em> 3rd year in PhD degree starts.</li>\n<li><em>(2023/04 - 2023/10)</em> I started to visit <a href=\"http://www.cs.emory.edu/site/aims/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">AIMS Lab</a> at Emory University as a visiting scholar. (supervised by Prof. <a href=\"http://www.cs.emory.edu/~lxiong/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Li Xiong</a>)</li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Fumiyuki Kato","date":null,"description":null,"socialImage":{"publicURL":"/static/59f685f581a10044ed42ce16dae0da45/fumilemon.png"}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/home/"}},"staticQueryHashes":["251939775","3563837177","401334301"]}